Cell["\<\
m is a nonnegative integer and -m <= photonIndex <= m. The internal dimension \
defaults to 1.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->1335248879,ExpressionUUID->"54ed713c-a91e-b449-8943-6ffcbf7c6d32"],

Cell["\<\
Returns the site/internal identity tensored with the single-sector photon \
projector. Its total matrix dimension is Length[points] internalDimension (2 \
m + 1).\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->1806874237,ExpressionUUID->"dc725e9d-a71c-764e-a6da-f34ac4407f37"],

Cell["\<\
Only Length[points] is used; the actual coordinate values do not enter the \
projector.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->844789920,ExpressionUUID->"bc033e41-eb9e-ad4e-af69-5aa934c822a4"]
}, Closed]],

